{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The memory-card-and-reader bundle fits my interest in practical computer accessories because it gives me a direct way to transfer files over USB 3.0.",
    "The SanDisk cards also fit that practical storage need, but I would choose the bundle with a reader now rather than buy extra cards."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo devices, smart plug, camera, and streaming sticks serve different purposes from the computer connections I have been buying; I have no current task that calls for them.",
    "Having bought a headset does not mean I need AirPods now, especially when I have not indicated that I use compatible Apple devices."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to treat an interest in computer accessories as an interest in household electronics generally.",
    "Several streaming and Alexa devices repeat the same assumption that I want entertainment or voice-assistant features, although my history gives little reason for that."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My WiFi adapter, USB expansion card, display cable, and most recent Ethernet adapter point toward connecting existing equipment and solving specific practical problems.",
    "I buy infrequently, so a related product needs a clear use now; an older headset purchase alone is not enough reason for me to replace it."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The storage recommendations partly understood my practical accessory needs, but most of the list mistook those needs for a broad interest in smart devices."
}"}
